  "description": "Tae Jungha and Baek Hosu have been friends for over ten years and became a cohabiting couple one year ago. But Hosu, feeling that Jungha doesn’t seem to love him, suggests they break up. However, Hosu forgets something— that they were a campus couple at the same university! From the day after the breakup, Jungha is everywhere on campus, making things uncomfortable. Yet the more Hosu tries to end their relationship, the more entangled they become. Can they really break up perfectly?\nSource: MU",
